# .env IS committed, by Edson's explicit decision, while the repo is public.
# This is deliberate and temporary. Deleting the file later does NOT remove the
# key from history — so before this project is finished the ElevenLabs key must
# be ROTATED in the dashboard, not merely deleted here.
# .env

# Generated demo fixtures. Rebuild with: python data/generate.py
data/demo_vault/

# Remembered facts are personal. Delete this line if you want them versioned.
memory/*.md

# History is more personal still: an answer about your accounts payable quotes
# your accounts payable. Delete this line to version it — which is also how you
# would sync it to another machine, since it is just files.
history/*.jsonl

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# Editor / OS
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
